From e500f6f9fd95fbbb14db2edfa692b00b981ab276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:23:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Filter the CRM customer view to designs linked to that
 customer

crm.deal returned the customer directory, which lists every design owned by
the merged person, so opening a customer showed every saved design on the
account. Add crm.customerDesigns, which filters server-side on the stored link:
crm_deal_designs for the deal and kitchen_designs.contractorCustomerId for the
deal's contractor customer folder. No link means an empty list, never a guess.

Also make the in-memory test store honour a multi-value IN predicate, which a
two-id inArray produces.
